WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.523
"What a great day," said Kip.

2
00:00:11.524 --> 00:00:14.529
"The sun is bright.

3
00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:17.233
And there are no clouds!"

4
00:00:17.234 --> 00:00:25.925
Boomph! A big acorn landed next to Kip.

5
00:00:25.926 --> 00:00:29.869
The acorn was round and shiny.

6
00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:32.710
Kip picked up the acorn and smiled.

7
00:00:32.711 --> 00:00:36.410
"This acorn is perfect," he said.

8
00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:45.431
"What a great day!"

9
00:00:45.432 --> 00:00:55.113
Kip walked back toward his tree.

10
00:00:55.114 --> 00:00:58.158
"That's a nice acorn," said Squirrel.

11
00:00:58.159 --> 00:01:03.671
"Thanks," said Kip.

12
00:01:03.672 --> 00:01:06.749
"Pretty acorn," said Mouse.

13
00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:10.487
"Thanks," said Kip.

14
00:01:10.488 --> 00:01:19.778
"I'm having a great day!"

15
00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:26.328
Kip walked across the bike path.

16
00:01:26.329 --> 00:01:30.118
"What a great day," said Kip.

17
00:01:30.119 --> 00:01:32.649
"The sun is bright.

18
00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:35.358
There are no clouds.

19
00:01:35.359 --> 00:01:38.603
And I found the best—oof!"

20
00:01:38.604 --> 00:01:41.487
Kip tripped over a stick.

21
00:01:41.488 --> 00:01:43.899
He dropped the acorn.

22
00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:54.097
The acorn rolled away.

23
00:01:54.098 --> 00:01:57.219
"Oh no!" cried Kip.

24
00:01:57.220 --> 00:02:00.489
Kip dived for the acorn.

25
00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:03.944
But he was too slow.

26
00:02:03.945 --> 00:02:10.119
The acorn was gone!

